blurb = "Depicts Daruma Daishi eating mounded dishes of soba noodles in a riverside noodle shop, as a shop assistant watches in disbelief.

Daruma Daishi is the Japanese name for the semi-legendary Indian monk Bodhidharma, who is credited with founding Zen Buddhism and bringing it to China in the 5th or 6th century."
